        'Add **Filter, Enhance, Bloom**: a high Brightness cutoff so only the highlights glow.',
        'Add **Filter, Distort, CRT** on top. Barrel distortion 20 to 50, Scanline gap to taste: denser for a small TV, wider for a big one.',
        'Optional: **Filter, Enhance, Vignette** for a deeper tube edge, and a slight **Film Grain** for signal noise.',
        'For text on the screen, put the text layer below the CRT filter so it bends and gets scanlines too.',
