        'Name each board for its slide (Cover, Point 1…, Last) in its card or by double-clicking its name in the Layers panel. The names become the file names.',
        'Copy the headline, page number and logo from the cover to each board (drag a layer\'s centre onto another board to move it there; duplicate first with {{Ctrl+J}} to copy).',
        'Write each slide: one point, one headline, a short supporting line. Zoom out with {{Ctrl+0}} to see the sequence together.',
        'Export: {{Ctrl+E}}, **All** under Boards to export, **PNG**, **1×**, tick **Number files in board order (01, 02…)**, then **Download N PNGs (zip)**. Upload the files in number order.',
