    summary: 'Twelve checks before a file goes to a printer, and the note to send with it. The things printers reject files for, in the order they check them.',
    description: 'Print handover checklist: trim size, bleed, safe area, 300 dpi at size, colour mode stated, fonts safe, crop marks if asked, file named with version, proof requested, paper and quantity confirmed. With the note to send.',
